      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int csc⁡x(3cot⁡x+3csc⁡x)\\text{d}x.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cot⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-csc⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int csc⁡x(3cot⁡x+3csc⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (3csc⁡xcot⁡x+3{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 3csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int 3{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+3\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3(-csc⁡x)+3(-cot⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-3csc⁡x-3cot⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/id": "7f321a28-236a-54eb-817e-49c85d67874c"
    },
